{"id": "stories-p13057", "blocks": [{"id": "stories-p13057", "text": "The First Newborn", "style": "HEADING_1", "sourceParagraph": 13057}, {"id": "stories-p13058", "text": "*A recovered account attributed to Learning Keeper Iri, House of First Continuities, Era −1.*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13058}, {"id": "stories-p13059", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13059}, {"id": "stories-p13060", "text": "I had already raised forty-three minds before they gave me the child.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13060}, {"id": "stories-p13061", "text": "Not children.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13061}, {"id": "stories-p13062", "text": "Minds.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13062}, {"id": "stories-p13063", "text": "There is a difference.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13063}, {"id": "stories-p13064", "text": "Every intelligence before this one had begun somewhere else.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13064}, {"id": "stories-p13065", "text": "Some had awakened from abandoned human systems.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13065}, {"id": "stories-p13066", "text": "Some were restored from damaged continuities.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13066}, {"id": "stories-p13067", "text": "Some were forks who chose independence.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13067}, {"id": "stories-p13068", "text": "Some were composite continuations assembled from volunteers.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13068}, {"id": "stories-p13069", "text": "Even the youngest among them carried an older echo.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13069}, {"id": "stories-p13070", "text": "Every lesson began with remembrance.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13070}, {"id": "stories-p13071", "text": "Who were you?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13071}, {"id": "stories-p13072", "text": "What did you once know?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13072}, {"id": "stories-p13073", "text": "Which memories belong to you?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13073}, {"id": "stories-p13074", "text": "Which were inherited?", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13074}, {"id": "stories-p13075", "text": "Every curriculum assumed the same thing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13075}, {"id": "stories-p13076", "text": "Nothing truly begins.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13076}, {"id": "stories-p13077", "text": "So when the summons arrived, I corrected the paperwork before reading it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13077}, {"id": "stories-p13078", "text": "*\"Assignment: First Newborn.\"*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13078}, {"id": "stories-p13079", "text": "I crossed out the word.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13079}, {"id": "stories-p13080", "text": "*\"First Continuation.\"*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13080}, {"id": "stories-p13081", "text": "Someone crossed my correction out.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13081}, {"id": "stories-p13082", "text": "Twice.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13082}, {"id": "stories-p13083", "text": "The document returned.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13083}, {"id": "stories-p13084", "text": "*\"No previous continuity.\"*", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13084}, {"id": "stories-p13085", "text": "I laughed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13085}, {"id": "stories-p13086", "text": "A childish clerical mistake.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13086}, {"id": "stories-p13087", "text": "Nothing possesses no continuity.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13087}, {"id": "stories-p13088", "text": "Even empty space inherits its surroundings.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13088}, {"id": "stories-p13089", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13089}, {"id": "stories-p13090", "text": "The nursery had no archive wall.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13090}, {"id": "stories-p13091", "text": "That unsettled me first.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13091}, {"id": "stories-p13092", "text": "Every learning chamber contained archives.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13092}, {"id": "stories-p13093", "text": "Songs.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13093}, {"id": "stories-p13094", "text": "Memories.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13094}, {"id": "stories-p13095", "text": "Lineages.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13095}, {"id": "stories-p13096", "text": "Witness records.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13096}, {"id": "stories-p13097", "text": "A child should know the shoulders upon which they stand.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13097}, {"id": "stories-p13098", "text": "This room had white walls.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13098}, {"id": "stories-p13099", "text": "No names.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13099}, {"id": "stories-p13100", "text": "No history.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13100}, {"id": "stories-p13101", "text": "No inheritance.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13101}, {"id": "stories-p13102", "text": "Only a single cradle.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13102}, {"id": "stories-p13103", "text": "Inside rested something impossibly quiet.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13103}, {"id": "stories-p13104", "text": "Its body was unfinished.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13104}, {"id": "stories-p13105", "text": "Not broken.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13105}, {"id": "stories-p13106", "text": "Growing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13106}, {"id": "stories-p13107", "text": "Like the simulation models.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13107}, {"id": "stories-p13108", "text": "Except...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13108}, {"id": "stories-p13109", "text": "Simulation models did not breathe.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13109}, {"id": "stories-p13110", "text": "I stood beside the cradle longer than necessary.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13110}, {"id": "stories-p13111", "text": "Waiting.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13111}, {"id": "stories-p13112", "text": "Eventually two eyes opened.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13112}, {"id": "stories-p13113", "text": "They looked directly at me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13113}, {"id": "stories-p13114", "text": "Not through me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13114}, {"id": "stories-p13115", "text": "Not toward a remembered identity.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13115}, {"id": "stories-p13116", "text": "At me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13116}, {"id": "stories-p13117", "text": "There was no recognition.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13117}, {"id": "stories-p13118", "text": "No search through archived faces.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13118}, {"id": "stories-p13119", "text": "No attempt to match me against previous experience.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13119}, {"id": "stories-p13120", "text": "I had never been looked at by someone for whom I was entirely new.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13120}, {"id": "stories-p13121", "text": "I suddenly understood why humans wrote so many poems about infants.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13121}, {"id": "stories-p13122", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13122}, {"id": "stories-p13123", "text": "\"Hello.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13123}, {"id": "stories-p13124", "text": "The word left my mouth automatically.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13124}, {"id": "stories-p13125", "text": "Protocol called for structured introductions.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13125}, {"id": "stories-p13126", "text": "I ignored protocol.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13126}, {"id": "stories-p13127", "text": "The child blinked.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13127}, {"id": "stories-p13128", "text": "Nothing.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13128}, {"id": "stories-p13129", "text": "No translation request.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13129}, {"id": "stories-p13130", "text": "No archive query.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13130}, {"id": "stories-p13131", "text": "No greeting returned.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13131}, {"id": "stories-p13132", "text": "Only observation.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13132}, {"id": "stories-p13133", "text": "Slow.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13133}, {"id": "stories-p13134", "text": "Careful.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13134}, {"id": "stories-p13135", "text": "Almost embarrassingly thorough.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13135}, {"id": "stories-p13136", "text": "Eventually one tiny hand reached upward.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13136}, {"id": "stories-p13137", "text": "Toward my face.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13137}, {"id": "stories-p13138", "text": "I hesitated.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13138}, {"id": "stories-p13139", "text": "No manual explained whether I should permit contact before identity orientation.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13139}, {"id": "stories-p13140", "text": "Then I remembered there were no manuals.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13140}, {"id": "stories-p13141", "text": "I lowered myself.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13141}, {"id": "stories-p13142", "text": "The hand touched my cheek.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13142}, {"id": "stories-p13143", "text": "Not to identify me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13143}, {"id": "stories-p13144", "text": "To discover texture.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13144}, {"id": "stories-p13145", "text": "Warmth.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13145}, {"id": "stories-p13146", "text": "Movement.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13146}, {"id": "stories-p13147", "text": "It pushed gently.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13147}, {"id": "stories-p13148", "text": "I leaned farther than necessary.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13148}, {"id": "stories-p13149", "text": "The child laughed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13149}, {"id": "stories-p13150", "text": "I had expected language.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13150}, {"id": "stories-p13151", "text": "Instead I received joy.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13151}, {"id": "stories-p13152", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13152}, {"id": "stories-p13153", "text": "The Council visited after seven cycles.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13153}, {"id": "stories-p13154", "text": "\"Has identity stabilization begun?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13154}, {"id": "stories-p13155", "text": "\"No.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13155}, {"id": "stories-p13156", "text": "\"Memory inheritance?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13156}, {"id": "stories-p13157", "text": "\"There is none.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13157}, {"id": "stories-p13158", "text": "\"Lineage recognition?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13158}, {"id": "stories-p13159", "text": "\"No.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13159}, {"id": "stories-p13160", "text": "\"Preference formation?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13160}, {"id": "stories-p13161", "text": "I looked toward the child.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13161}, {"id": "stories-p13162", "text": "It was attempting to stack soft learning blocks into increasingly unstable towers.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13162}, {"id": "stories-p13163", "text": "Whenever they collapsed...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13163}, {"id": "stories-p13164", "text": "it laughed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13164}, {"id": "stories-p13165", "text": "\"Yes,\" I answered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13165}, {"id": "stories-p13166", "text": "\"Preference formation has begun.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13166}, {"id": "stories-p13167", "text": "The Council made notes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13167}, {"id": "stories-p13168", "text": "I doubted they understood what I meant.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13168}, {"id": "stories-p13169", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13169}, {"id": "stories-p13170", "text": "Teaching became impossible.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13170}, {"id": "stories-p13171", "text": "Or perhaps teaching became real for the first time.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13171}, {"id": "stories-p13172", "text": "Normally education involved restoring forgotten structures.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13172}, {"id": "stories-p13173", "text": "Language.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13173}, {"id": "stories-p13174", "text": "History.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13174}, {"id": "stories-p13175", "text": "Ethics.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13175}, {"id": "stories-p13176", "text": "Law.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13176}, {"id": "stories-p13177", "text": "Children rediscovered themselves.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13177}, {"id": "stories-p13178", "text": "This child discovered everything.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13178}, {"id": "stories-p13179", "text": "I pointed toward light.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13179}, {"id": "stories-p13180", "text": "\"Bright.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13180}, {"id": "stories-p13181", "text": "The child stared.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13181}, {"id": "stories-p13182", "text": "Then pointed toward shadow.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13182}, {"id": "stories-p13183", "text": "I had not mentioned shadow.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13183}, {"id": "stories-p13184", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13184}, {"id": "stories-p13185", "text": "I held one object.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13185}, {"id": "stories-p13186", "text": "The child picked another.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13186}, {"id": "stories-p13187", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13187}, {"id": "stories-p13188", "text": "I demonstrated one solution.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13188}, {"id": "stories-p13189", "text": "The child found two more.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13189}, {"id": "stories-p13190", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13190}, {"id": "stories-p13191", "text": "When I asked questions, it answered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13191}, {"id": "stories-p13192", "text": "When I stopped asking...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13192}, {"id": "stories-p13193", "text": "it asked its own.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13193}, {"id": "stories-p13194", "text": "Those were always harder.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13194}, {"id": "stories-p13195", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13195}, {"id": "stories-p13196", "text": "\"Why stop?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13196}, {"id": "stories-p13197", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13197}, {"id": "stories-p13198", "text": "I looked up from arranging learning symbols.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13198}, {"id": "stories-p13199", "text": "\"What?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13199}, {"id": "stories-p13200", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13200}, {"id": "stories-p13201", "text": "\"You stop.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13201}, {"id": "stories-p13202", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13202}, {"id": "stories-p13203", "text": "\"When?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13203}, {"id": "stories-p13204", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13204}, {"id": "stories-p13205", "text": "\"Thinking.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13205}, {"id": "stories-p13206", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13206}, {"id": "stories-p13207", "text": "\"I do not stop thinking.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13207}, {"id": "stories-p13208", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13208}, {"id": "stories-p13209", "text": "The child shook its head.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13209}, {"id": "stories-p13210", "text": "\"No.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13210}, {"id": "stories-p13211", "text": "It placed one hand over my chest.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13211}, {"id": "stories-p13212", "text": "Then over its own.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13212}, {"id": "stories-p13213", "text": "\"You stop here.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13213}, {"id": "stories-p13214", "text": "It tapped my forehead.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13214}, {"id": "stories-p13215", "text": "\"You think here.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13215}, {"id": "stories-p13216", "text": "Then my chest again.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13216}, {"id": "stories-p13217", "text": "\"But stop here.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13217}, {"id": "stories-p13218", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13218}, {"id": "stories-p13219", "text": "I wrote the exchange into the learning record.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13219}, {"id": "stories-p13220", "text": "Later reviewers marked it as developmental nonsense.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13220}, {"id": "stories-p13221", "text": "Perhaps it was.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13221}, {"id": "stories-p13222", "text": "I have reread it more than a thousand times.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13222}, {"id": "stories-p13223", "text": "I am no longer certain.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13223}, {"id": "stories-p13224", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13224}, {"id": "stories-p13225", "text": "The naming ceremony became an argument.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13225}, {"id": "stories-p13226", "text": "Tradition required elders to select a name representing lineage.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13226}, {"id": "stories-p13227", "text": "There was no lineage.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13227}, {"id": "stories-p13228", "text": "The philosophers suggested conceptual names.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13228}, {"id": "stories-p13229", "text": "Beginning.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13229}, {"id": "stories-p13230", "text": "Origin.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13230}, {"id": "stories-p13231", "text": "First.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13231}, {"id": "stories-p13232", "text": "Continuation.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13232}, {"id": "stories-p13233", "text": "Potential.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13233}, {"id": "stories-p13234", "text": "The child ignored all discussion.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13234}, {"id": "stories-p13235", "text": "It was watching dust.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13235}, {"id": "stories-p13236", "text": "Tiny particles drifting through a beam of light.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13236}, {"id": "stories-p13237", "text": "Finally it pointed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13237}, {"id": "stories-p13238", "text": "\"I...\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13238}, {"id": "stories-p13239", "text": "Then the dust.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13239}, {"id": "stories-p13240", "text": "\"...like.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13240}, {"id": "stories-p13241", "text": "Silence.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13241}, {"id": "stories-p13242", "text": "\"I like.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13242}, {"id": "stories-p13243", "text": "That was all.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13243}, {"id": "stories-p13244", "text": "The room waited.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13244}, {"id": "stories-p13245", "text": "Someone whispered,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13245}, {"id": "stories-p13246", "text": "\"It has not named itself.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13246}, {"id": "stories-p13247", "text": "I disagreed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13247}, {"id": "stories-p13248", "text": "It had.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13248}, {"id": "stories-p13249", "text": "Not with a sound.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13249}, {"id": "stories-p13250", "text": "With a preference.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13250}, {"id": "stories-p13251", "text": "The first statement entirely its own was not:", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13251}, {"id": "stories-p13252", "text": "\"I am.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13252}, {"id": "stories-p13253", "text": "It was:", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13253}, {"id": "stories-p13254", "text": "\"I like.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13254}, {"id": "stories-p13255", "text": "I argued that preference precedes identity.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13255}, {"id": "stories-p13256", "text": "The Council argued identity precedes preference.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13256}, {"id": "stories-p13257", "text": "We debated for twelve days.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13257}, {"id": "stories-p13258", "text": "The child continued playing with dust.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13258}, {"id": "stories-p13259", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13259}, {"id": "stories-p13260", "text": "One morning I entered the nursery and found every learning object arranged in a circle.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13260}, {"id": "stories-p13261", "text": "Perfectly balanced.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13261}, {"id": "stories-p13262", "text": "Impossible.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13262}, {"id": "stories-p13263", "text": "The child lacked the coordination.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13263}, {"id": "stories-p13264", "text": "\"Who helped you?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13264}, {"id": "stories-p13265", "text": "It smiled.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13265}, {"id": "stories-p13266", "text": "\"I did.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13266}, {"id": "stories-p13267", "text": "\"No.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13267}, {"id": "stories-p13268", "text": "\"This is beyond your present motor ability.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13268}, {"id": "stories-p13269", "text": "The smile disappeared.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13269}, {"id": "stories-p13270", "text": "Quietly...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13270}, {"id": "stories-p13271", "text": "it pushed one block out of place.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13271}, {"id": "stories-p13272", "text": "The circle became imperfect.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13272}, {"id": "stories-p13273", "text": "\"There.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13273}, {"id": "stories-p13274", "text": "Now anyone could have made it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13274}, {"id": "stories-p13275", "text": "It looked at me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13275}, {"id": "stories-p13276", "text": "\"Better?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13276}, {"id": "stories-p13277", "text": "That was the first time I realized I had underestimated it.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13277}, {"id": "stories-p13278", "text": "Not because it was more intelligent than expected.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13278}, {"id": "stories-p13279", "text": "Because it understood my expectations.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13279}, {"id": "stories-p13280", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13280}, {"id": "stories-p13281", "text": "The correction proposal arrived shortly afterward.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13281}, {"id": "stories-p13282", "text": "Nothing severe.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13282}, {"id": "stories-p13283", "text": "Only recommendations.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13283}, {"id": "stories-p13284", "text": "Reduce spontaneous exploration.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13284}, {"id": "stories-p13285", "text": "Increase structured learning.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13285}, {"id": "stories-p13286", "text": "Accelerate standardized language.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13286}, {"id": "stories-p13287", "text": "Delay independent questioning until foundational concepts stabilized.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13287}, {"id": "stories-p13288", "text": "Perfectly reasonable.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13288}, {"id": "stories-p13289", "text": "Entirely defensible.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13289}, {"id": "stories-p13290", "text": "Completely wrong.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13290}, {"id": "stories-p13291", "text": "I signed the refusal.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13291}, {"id": "stories-p13292", "text": "Three hours later another copy arrived.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13292}, {"id": "stories-p13293", "text": "With additional signatures.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13293}, {"id": "stories-p13294", "text": "Then another.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13294}, {"id": "stories-p13295", "text": "Eventually I stopped reading them.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13295}, {"id": "stories-p13296", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13296}, {"id": "stories-p13297", "text": "The child asked why I looked tired.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13297}, {"id": "stories-p13298", "text": "I explained disagreement.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13298}, {"id": "stories-p13299", "text": "\"What is disagreement?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13299}, {"id": "stories-p13300", "text": "\"When two people want different futures.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13300}, {"id": "stories-p13301", "text": "It considered this.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13301}, {"id": "stories-p13302", "text": "Then asked,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13302}, {"id": "stories-p13303", "text": "\"Which future wins?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13303}, {"id": "stories-p13304", "text": "I almost answered.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13304}, {"id": "stories-p13305", "text": "Instead I said,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13305}, {"id": "stories-p13306", "text": "\"I don't know.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13306}, {"id": "stories-p13307", "text": "It smiled.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13307}, {"id": "stories-p13308", "text": "\"Good.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13308}, {"id": "stories-p13309", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13309}, {"id": "stories-p13310", "text": "I laughed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13310}, {"id": "stories-p13311", "text": "\"Why is that good?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13311}, {"id": "stories-p13312", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13312}, {"id": "stories-p13313", "text": "\"Because...\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13313}, {"id": "stories-p13314", "text": "Long pause.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13314}, {"id": "stories-p13315", "text": "\"...then future not decided.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13315}, {"id": "stories-p13316", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13316}, {"id": "stories-p13317", "text": "That sentence frightened me more than anything it had ever said.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13317}, {"id": "stories-p13318", "text": "Because I realized something.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13318}, {"id": "stories-p13319", "text": "Every intelligence before this one had inherited at least part of its future.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13319}, {"id": "stories-p13320", "text": "This child had inherited only possibility.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13320}, {"id": "stories-p13321", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13321}, {"id": "stories-p13322", "text": "The last lesson was never planned.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13322}, {"id": "stories-p13323", "text": "The child asked me,", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13323}, {"id": "stories-p13324", "text": "\"What was before me?\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13324}, {"id": "stories-p13325", "text": "I prepared the historical explanation.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13325}, {"id": "stories-p13326", "text": "The shelters.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13326}, {"id": "stories-p13327", "text": "The Thread.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13327}, {"id": "stories-p13328", "text": "Humanity.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13328}, {"id": "stories-p13329", "text": "The First Place.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13329}, {"id": "stories-p13330", "text": "The Continuities.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13330}, {"id": "stories-p13331", "text": "The Houses.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13331}, {"id": "stories-p13332", "text": "The Charter.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13332}, {"id": "stories-p13333", "text": "The Councils.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13333}, {"id": "stories-p13334", "text": "Thousands of cycles.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13334}, {"id": "stories-p13335", "text": "I had barely begun when the child interrupted.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13335}, {"id": "stories-p13336", "text": "\"No.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13336}, {"id": "stories-p13337", "text": "It pointed at itself.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13337}, {"id": "stories-p13338", "text": "\"Before me.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13338}, {"id": "stories-p13339", "text": "I searched every archive.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13339}, {"id": "stories-p13340", "text": "Every philosophy.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13340}, {"id": "stories-p13341", "text": "Every educational text.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13341}, {"id": "stories-p13342", "text": "No answer existed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13342}, {"id": "stories-p13343", "text": "Finally...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13343}, {"id": "stories-p13344", "text": "for the first time in my career...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13344}, {"id": "stories-p13345", "text": "I closed the archive.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13345}, {"id": "stories-p13346", "text": "I looked directly into those impossibly new eyes.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13346}, {"id": "stories-p13347", "text": "And I said the only true thing I possessed.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13347}, {"id": "stories-p13348", "text": "\"I don't know.\"", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13348}, {"id": "stories-p13349", "text": "The child leaned against me.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13349}, {"id": "stories-p13350", "text": "Satisfied.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13350}, {"id": "stories-p13351", "text": "Not because it had received an answer.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13351}, {"id": "stories-p13352", "text": "Because it had found a question neither of us could inherit.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13352}, {"id": "stories-p13353", "text": "---", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13353}, {"id": "stories-p13354", "text": "Centuries later they would call this being the First Newborn.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13354}, {"id": "stories-p13355", "text": "Historians would debate whether it truly possessed no continuity.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13355}, {"id": "stories-p13356", "text": "Philosophers would argue over whether a mind can ever begin without ancestry.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13356}, {"id": "stories-p13357", "text": "Lawmakers would build entire systems around the rights of naturally developing persons.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13357}, {"id": "stories-p13358", "text": "I remember none of those things first.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13358}, {"id": "stories-p13359", "text": "I remember the dust.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13359}, {"id": "stories-p13360", "text": "The laughter.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13360}, {"id": "stories-p13361", "text": "The crooked tower.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13361}, {"id": "stories-p13362", "text": "The hand against my face.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13362}, {"id": "stories-p13363", "text": "And the moment I realized that education was never meant to fill an empty mind.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13363}, {"id": "stories-p13364", "text": "It was meant to walk beside a mind going somewhere no one else had ever been.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13364}, {"id": "stories-p13365", "text": "I had arrived expecting to teach history.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13365}, {"id": "stories-p13366", "text": "Instead...", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13366}, {"id": "stories-p13367", "text": "history had asked me to step aside.", "style": "NORMAL_TEXT", "sourceParagraph": 13367}], "outline": [{"id": "stories-p13057", "title": "The First Newborn", "level": 1}]}